{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "548f6103-2d0d-5817-84eb-8da07cd01253", "source_ordinal": 2566, "reading_ordinal": 1487, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "不打盲人", "published_at": "2022-10-11T21:00:46+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/64386030/answer/2711297693"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "盲人要是撞到你，你难道会打ta一顿吗？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "遇到这种事，主要是要重新发信号，确认一下对方是不是确实是盲人。", "char_start": 20, "char_end": 51}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "发现对方确实是盲人，自然就没什么“反击”的想法了。", "char_start": 52, "char_end": 77}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "连跟我这么好相处的人都相处不来，人生已经非常可怜了，实无必要落井下石。", "char_start": 79, "char_end": 114}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 5}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0231"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：怎么反击讽刺你的人？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004"], "summary": "围绕“不打盲人”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“盲人要是撞到你，你难道会打ta一顿吗？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "盲人要是撞到你，你难道会打ta一顿吗？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "e6ada624-544d-5ce1-a752-265b2f9d12da", "source_ordinal": 2565, "reading_ordinal": 1488, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "镜中妖", "published_at": "2022-10-14T04:44:32+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/555999372/answer/2714506828"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "说实在的，在知乎的俄乌战争问题下，体现了很多很严重的心理问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 31}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "其中最严重、最典型的一种问题，就是从这种“普京错在xxxx”的言论里流露出的傲慢和脆弱。", "char_start": 32, "char_end": 76}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "为什么这么说呢？", "char_start": 78, "char_end": 86}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "先说傲慢。", "char_start": 87, "char_end": 92}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这些批评的全部“理论依据”，说穿了是来自于事实与当事人自己对“事情应该是怎么样”的想象的落差。", "char_start": 93, "char_end": 140}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "当事人在反复呈现这样一种行为模式——只要存在这种落差，就断言是“普京犯了严重错误”，而丝毫不怀疑自己对事情的想象犯了错误。", "char_start": 141, "char_end": 202}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "仔细检查ta们的言论，你会发现ta们普遍对“我可能猜错了普京的意图”没有投入过任何一丁点资源、做哪怕最粗浅的推敲，ta们从不对此做哪怕任何论证，就毫不犹豫的、毫无警觉的全面押注“我对普京的意图判断不可能有任何错误，只可能是普京的意图落空了”。", "char_start": 203, "char_end": 324}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这是一种严重认知障碍和思维缺陷。", "char_start": 325, "char_end": 341}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "哪怕你装装样子、走个过场，你也必须养成习惯，去首先“行礼如仪”的排除一下你判断错误的可能。就算是牵强附会，你也要找一些客观的依据来证明与你相反的判断有一定概率不成立，而不能直接把这些基本的检查过程留空、绕过。", "char_start": 342, "char_end": 446}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "总要有那么一个自然段、一两句话担当这个“为什么相反的观点不成立”的职能，把这个空填了，这是一个最基本的思考问题的SOP。", "char_start": 447, "char_end": 507}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "就这样完全留空、绕过，直接诉诸“自信”去直奔下一步，意味着一个人还没有可以有效运转、值得最基本的信赖的思维习惯。", "char_start": 508, "char_end": 564}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这种思维习惯，是一种思想上的“训练痕迹”，一种将思考付诸实践后必然会得到教训、从而必然会养成的条件反射。", "char_start": 565, "char_end": 617}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "没这个习惯，意味着你根本就没有过真刀真枪的将自己的判断力付诸过实践，没有担当过什么现实的职责，没有承担过什么实际的风险。", "char_start": 618, "char_end": 678}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "一言以蔽之，你根本就不是个独立生活过、行走过江湖的成年人。", "char_start": 679, "char_end": 708}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "因为世界上是没有这种没有经过现实的千百次迎头痛击，生下来就能毫无受伤记忆的做到“料事如神”、“算无遗策”的人的。", "char_start": 709, "char_end": 765}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "如此残破的思维方式，只会是因为被某种保温膜、保险套包起来了，没有任何权力，于是也造成不了什么损失，从而也没有什么可刻骨铭心的惨痛教训，所以才会对这种极端危险的思维陋习没有本能的焦虑。", "char_start": 766, "char_end": 857}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "问题是这种“不破产”的“安全状态”，同时又意味着无能和无力。", "char_start": 858, "char_end": 888}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这样思考问题，在其他明白这个道理的人面前仅凭本能就会被排除——你所推销的计划、鼓吹的策略、主张的建议，都会被人“莫名其妙”的无视。", "char_start": 889, "char_end": 954}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "这就是你“没机会”“没出息”“不受尊重”的原因之一。", "char_start": 955, "char_end": 981}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "第二，对“没有错误的状态”有极其严重的误解。", "char_start": 983, "char_end": 1005}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "什么样的误解？", "char_start": 1006, "char_end": 1013}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "就是误认为“没有错误”肯定意味着没有曲折和痛苦。", "char_start": 1014, "char_end": 1038}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "只有绝对直线、指数增长、完全光滑、零损失、零伤亡、无焦虑、无恐慌、无不确定……的总和，才叫做“没有错误”。", "char_start": 1039, "char_end": 1092}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "要是非直线、有下降过程、不光滑、有损失、有伤亡、有焦虑、有恐慌、有不确定……中的任何一种，那就叫“犯了错误”。", "char_start": 1093, "char_end": 1148}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "而因为这种可悲到可笑的脆弱心态，只要有损失，必然对这朵温室娇花构成“不可想象的损失”，从而导致“犯有严重错误”的结论。", "char_start": 1149, "char_end": 1208}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "那种豆腐般的软弱和敏感，经由“我不可能犯错”的加工，就构成了上面那种可悲的思维习惯。", "char_start": 1209, "char_end": 1251}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "人脆弱到只能接受“完美过程”，人生必定寸步难移—— 一天到晚做一些名为“计划”“筹备”，实则是逃避、投降的“努力”。", "char_start": 1253, "char_end": 1311}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "一辈子“过家家”，躲在父母的翅膀下君临天下。", "char_start": 1312, "char_end": 1334}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "哎呀呀，有曲折、有损失、有不确定，那可多痛苦啊！一开始就知道会有这些东西还要去做，那岂不是愚蠢吗？这本身不就是“严重错误”吗？", "char_start": 1336, "char_end": 1399}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "现在再去看看这些答案，从这个角度去审视一下这些嬉笑怒骂、“风趣幽默”的“普京指导者”。", "char_start": 1401, "char_end": 1444}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "你会默默希望ta们都是网军账号和发帖机器人的。", "char_start": 1445, "char_end": 1468}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "因为如果是真的人类——尤其是已经成年的人类——还是这样既脆弱、又傲慢的思维状态。", "char_start": 1469, "char_end": 1509}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "前面的人生恐怕充满了折磨和痛苦。", "char_start": 1510, "char_end": 1526}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "这不是指什么中美争霸、俄乌争端。", "char_start": 1527, "char_end": 1543}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "而是指普普通通的工作、生活就将对ta们构成肝胆俱裂的风险和恐惧，而现在将普京定性为“蠢材”的思维结构，在不久的将来会将ta们自己宣判为更糟糕百倍的废物。", "char_start": 1544, "char_end": 1620}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "地狱就在前面。", "char_start": 1621, "char_end": 1628}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "这种心理瘟疫正在随着西方媒体的认知战弥漫在整个西方世界——要鼓动起无知的人信从ta们鼓吹的乐观预期，ta们其实就同时在强化这种建立在病态“无误基线”和回避自我怀疑前提下的精神疾病。", "char_start": 1630, "char_end": 1720}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "所以1450普遍都有职业精神病。", "char_start": 1721, "char_end": 1737}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "拿起这面照妖镜，顺着列表看下来，吸取教训。", "char_start": 1739, "char_end": 1760}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 46}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0231"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：乌克兰问题上，普京最大的失误是什么？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039"], "summary": "围绕“镜中妖”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“说实在的，在知乎的俄乌战争问题下，体现了很多很严重的心理问题。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "说实在的，在知乎的俄乌战争问题下，体现了很多很严重的心理问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 31, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "8f454a1f-d9ae-50a8-85f4-4f6da1efff62", "source_ordinal": 2564, "reading_ordinal": 1489, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "有匪君子", "published_at": "2022-10-15T22:31:58+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/283850616/answer/2716909857"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "其实一个人的“匪气”，不是指一个人粗糙、草莽，而是指一个人看上去就不脆弱。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 37}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "不会你一句话说得不合适就自怨自艾；不会你一个眼神不对，就患得患失；不会你一个反应不好，就怀恨在心。", "char_start": 38, "char_end": 87}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "大大咧咧、豪爽草莽，只是表象，真正重要的是让人觉得安全、有容错率，从而不必那么紧张会说错话、表错情，会莫名其妙多一个敌人。", "char_start": 88, "char_end": 149}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这个效果其实通过其它途径也可以达到，只是通过“粗豪草莽”的表现去传达，还能给人一种“我是个粗人，没什么文化，因此我对人的威胁都很直接浅白，不难对付”的弱者感。", "char_start": 150, "char_end": 229}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "一种“我的地位比你低”的外露感。", "char_start": 230, "char_end": 246}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这种站位、这种气质对做上门销售这种工作有一定的好处，但并不是绝对必要的，也有它一定的副作用——也有人不喜欢这种咋咋唬唬的草莽风格，因为有一定的攻击性。", "char_start": 247, "char_end": 322}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "真正重要的是不让人感到脆弱。", "char_start": 323, "char_end": 337}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "让人感到你很脆弱，好像精致的蛋壳瓷，摸一摸就脏了，碰一碰就裂了，还很高级赔不起，那么人家就要敬你而远之。", "char_start": 338, "char_end": 390}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这有几个基本的诀窍，你们自己举一反三。", "char_start": 391, "char_end": 410}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "比如外观上，就不要选择那种过于精致规整、不耐脏、不耐劳的外表。", "char_start": 411, "char_end": 442}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "比如雪白的亚麻、纯黑纯蓝的羊毛呢、净面的丝绸、光滑如水的钢琴漆之类。一挨着你就是个灰印子、油印子或者会挑丝，自然与不脆弱没关系了，那体现出的就是一种“一挨就赔”的富贵逼人。", "char_start": 443, "char_end": 529}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "要比着军用、工业用、劳保用的格调去管理外观。", "char_start": 530, "char_end": 552}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "做旧皮的、纯铜的、钢的、钛的、磨花用光的、牛仔的、咔叽的、凯夫拉的、碳纤的、机能的……", "char_start": 553, "char_end": 596}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "要给人一种“如果现在有人向你扫射，你可以立刻卧倒、翻滚、找到掩护、捡块砖头扔回去、然后一个飞扑揪住对方的脖领子把对方呛晕在厕所里、再找阿姨借个拖把把地拖干净”的感觉。", "char_start": 597, "char_end": 680}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "遣词造句上，不要无意义的文言化、学术化。要把不得不用术语看成一种遗憾、随口抱歉，而不是拿这些东西当成自豪源泉。", "char_start": 682, "char_end": 737}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "语言表达上，不要哀怨。", "char_start": 739, "char_end": 750}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "什么“反正你心里没我”“我总是没人疼的”“我能有什么办法呢”“倒霉的总是我”“是我不配”之类的鬼话少讲。你讲了这话——或者你没讲但流露了这个意思，听到这话人就要害怕自己是你下一个幽怨的原因，自然而然要惹不起还躲不起。", "char_start": 751, "char_end": 859}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "作为儿童，向自己的父母展示脆弱也许会得到安慰和糖果。", "char_start": 860, "char_end": 886}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "但是作为成年人，向别人展示脆弱，得到安慰和糖果之后要报以加倍的感激。", "char_start": 887, "char_end": 921}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "理论上，在展示脆弱、得到安慰后回报感激，这个循环可以稳定。", "char_start": 922, "char_end": 951}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "但这个加倍感激部分，往往获得者是没有自觉、也并不会去做的。于是客观结果往往是对方还没有得到加倍感激，就得到了第二次“脆弱通知”。", "char_start": 952, "char_end": 1016}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "那是很容易翻脸的。", "char_start": 1017, "char_end": 1026}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "这也是人们为什么会更大概率孤立“哀怨的成年人”的原因。", "char_start": 1027, "char_end": 1054}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "也是为什么有人要你学点“匪气”的原因。", "char_start": 1055, "char_end": 1074}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 26}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0231"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何锻炼一个人的匪气？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024"], "summary": "围绕“有匪君子”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“其实一个人的“匪气”，不是指一个人粗糙、草莽，而是指一个人看上去就不脆弱。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "其实一个人的“匪气”，不是指一个人粗糙、草莽，而是指一个人看上去就不脆弱。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 37, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "25fc6c41-fd55-5d14-a8e3-8cb8dcce81d9", "source_ordinal": 2563, "reading_ordinal": 1490, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "搞点科学", "published_at": "2022-10-16T01:27:16+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/552121513/answer/2717066208"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "“民间科学家”恐怕是中国特有的特殊概念。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这种概念之所以会出现，这话声因为中国的科学研究自从清末、民国、共和国初创开始直到现在，都主要呈现出一种官办、国立的体制内垄断生态。", "char_start": 21, "char_end": 86}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "学术研究基本上不是在大学就是在科研院所、央企国企、事业单位。", "char_start": 87, "char_end": 117}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "只有极少数在大型民企——往往也少不了国有成分、体制血统。", "char_start": 118, "char_end": 146}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "因此导致了一种恶习，认为“体制外无学术”。", "char_start": 147, "char_end": 168}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这种情结一走出国门就完全不是这么回事了。", "char_start": 169, "char_end": 189}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "耶鲁、哈佛、普林斯顿都是私立大学。", "char_start": 190, "char_end": 207}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "拉瓦锡、法拉第、孟德尔——甚至算上达尔文，这都是现代科学学科的开创者，你回去翻翻看他们的生平，按中国的算法，都属于不折不扣的“民间科学家”。", "char_start": 208, "char_end": 278}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "在科学面前，“体制内”根本没有任何提起的必要。", "char_start": 279, "char_end": 302}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "写《昆虫记》的法布尔，一度当过铁路工人，柠檬小贩。", "char_start": 303, "char_end": 328}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "那又怎样？谁到后来不承认他的成就？晚年还差点得了诺贝尔文学奖。", "char_start": 329, "char_end": 360}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "科学从诞生的第一天起，本身就是很“民”的东西，“体制内科学”反而才是后来诞生的新鲜品种。", "char_start": 361, "char_end": 405}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "不可否认，“体制内学术”因为时代原因有它压倒性的必要性——在“民”普遍财力不足甚至温饱都成问题，文化教育水平普遍只在“脱盲率”上挣扎的年代，无疑民间科学会极为弱势，乏善可陈。", "char_start": 406, "char_end": 493}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "大部分民间科学研究都会和职业实践有关，而在一个国家还在追赶先进水平、做别人做过的作业的阶段，这个区间当然也罕有建树。", "char_start": 494, "char_end": 552}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "但是，不要觉得这是“天经地义”、甚至“天行有常”的。", "char_start": 553, "char_end": 579}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "欠缺学术能力的一种典型表现，就是将有历史性的暂时现象误认为是超越性的规律。", "char_start": 580, "char_end": 617}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "凡嘲讽“民科”的人，一开始就犯了这种ABC级的错误——这本身就是一个欠缺科学素养才会有的嘲讽，which is another poetic irony。", "char_start": 618, "char_end": 695}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "其实，中国民间科学研究正处在一个即将到来的春天的前夜，腊八粥已经喝过了，已经开始捣年糕要过除夕了。", "char_start": 697, "char_end": 746}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "第一是中国已经客观上拥有了一批足够富有的中产阶级专业人士。ta们的子女受到的教育和熏陶与50-80后这批人所受的技工教育有很大的差异，大幅的偏向于研究和探索。美学教育也大踏步的赶上了。", "char_start": 747, "char_end": 839}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "第二是中国的产业部门已经从追赶模仿逐渐逼近了要与第一梯队争先。不管是弯道超车、换道超车或者干脆是直道超车，只要领先就要进入无人之境。", "char_start": 840, "char_end": 906}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "十四亿人要“不被掐脖子的”、无短板的全面领先或不落后，那绝非仅靠“体制内科学家”就能解决的需求。", "char_start": 907, "char_end": 955}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "无论是私企还是个人，都会看到越来越强的需求。大笔的资金等着买“领先彩票”。", "char_start": 956, "char_end": 993}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "唯一的障碍，反而正是这种“我没进科班/体制所以我与科学无缘”的自我阉割。", "char_start": 994, "char_end": 1030}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "不要理会这类沉浸在恐惧中的庸人，ta们根本无足轻重。", "char_start": 1031, "char_end": 1057}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "搞科学研究乃至搞学术，你可以直接无视“民间”两个字。", "char_start": 1059, "char_end": 1085}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "什么民间不民间？", "char_start": 1086, "char_end": 1094}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "世界上只有一种科学研究者，就是讲科学的科学研究者。", "char_start": 1095, "char_end": 1120}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "这种人，眼里只看到数据和表达式，只看到逻辑和图表，看不见“工作单位”、性别、种族、国籍和宗教信仰。", "char_start": 1121, "char_end": 1170}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "ta们既不以民科自居，也不享受任何“民科的福利”。", "char_start": 1171, "char_end": 1196}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "这类人对该做的论证、实验，不会因为自己不在体制内而打一分折扣——因为这不是民科不民科的问题，而是科学不科学、学术不学术的问题。", "char_start": 1197, "char_end": 1260}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "这类人不会把其他科学研究者看作敌人，无端要搞第二套术语体系来抬高理解和沟通成本。", "char_start": 1261, "char_end": 1301}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "坦率讲，人没有学术方面的兴趣是非常可惜的。这还不是“创造科学史”、“造福人类”的事，而是拥有学术兴趣，对人的心理健康是一个极大的帮助。", "char_start": 1303, "char_end": 1370}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "有学术爱好、研究兴趣的人，是一个在最基本层面上能体会思想的、精神的乐趣于是能在很大程度上对功利心免疫的人。", "char_start": 1371, "char_end": 1424}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "这是一个极大的稳定器、避风港，因为这种纯学术的好奇、理性的洞察，是一种充满神性的作为，有着其他一切行为所难以企及的神性享乐。", "char_start": 1425, "char_end": 1487}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "而且它还是绝对健康、绝对积极、绝对正面的。", "char_start": 1488, "char_end": 1509}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "简单来说，这是生而为人的一项专属的福利，任何人放弃它——或者不管因为什么原因自认为与它无缘——都是一种极为可惜的重大损失。", "char_start": 1510, "char_end": 1571}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "就纯为快乐，你难道不好奇吗？", "char_start": 1572, "char_end": 1586}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "你是个人，不是一个别的什么动物。", "char_start": 1588, "char_end": 1604}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "不要枉为人。", "char_start": 1605, "char_end": 1611}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 43}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0231"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：民科要想不被鄙视，应该重点做些什么？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039"], "summary": "围绕“搞点科学”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：““民间科学家”恐怕是中国特有的特殊概念。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "“民间科学家”恐怕是中国特有的特殊概念。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "fa459333-0487-5237-b6de-9bdd927ec0e8", "source_ordinal": 2562, "reading_ordinal": 1491, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "世风日下", "published_at": "2022-10-16T12:33:11+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/20034742/answer/2717463472"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "人类是普遍优待儿童而对成人比较严格的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "换句话来说，几乎每一个人都会在童年得到更多的宽容、鼓励和供应。到了成年，那些宽容、忍让和优待就不见了。", "char_start": 20, "char_end": 71}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这是一个很直观而且很显著的“道德滑坡”，而且触达每个人。", "char_start": 72, "char_end": 100}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你当然会因此觉得十几二十年前——实际上也就是你的童年时代——“人际关系淳朴”，但这种感受要转化为“世风日下”的有效证据，很显然还需要排除掉你的“童年滤镜”。", "char_start": 101, "char_end": 179}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这就很为难了。", "char_start": 180, "char_end": 187}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "因为很多证据表明，即使连环杀人犯、侵略军都常会对儿童和气微笑、网开一面。这一干扰效应幅度之大，如同家里的空调对全球变暖研究的干扰——只要你不出门，世界明明是恒温的，哪来什么“变暖”。", "char_start": 188, "char_end": 279}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "时代本身的上升，很可能远远抵消不了你个人感受的下降。", "char_start": 280, "char_end": 306}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "在很大程度上，这也是为什么每个人都会倾向于赞同这个观点的原因——因为几乎每个人都会亲身经历这个“人际关系严苛化”的过程。每个人都会觉得自己还是小孩子的时候人际关系没现在这么紧张。", "char_start": 307, "char_end": 396}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "殊不知，给你牛轧糖的隔壁王大伯，恰恰就是那个挤占了你父亲升职名额的对手；前院扶你起身的给你涂药的张大妈，正是隔壁楼下李二狗老妈的死敌。", "char_start": 397, "char_end": 464}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你的父母正在拿着你觉得淳朴的数据样本作为ta们觉得世风日下的实验依据。", "char_start": 465, "char_end": 500}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "你必须先排除掉这个童年滤镜，才能和同样排除掉这个童年滤镜的其他人有意义的谈论这个话题。", "char_start": 501, "char_end": 544}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "两个未排除童年滤镜的人凑在一起，得出这个“共识”是很自然的。", "char_start": 545, "char_end": 575}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "人人都有世风日下感，并不理所当然的意味着世风日下。", "char_start": 576, "char_end": 601}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "人的共识并非真理的标准——哪怕在“社科领域”也一样如此。", "char_start": 602, "char_end": 630}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 14}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0231"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：中国人的道德真的在滑坡吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014"], "summary": "围绕“世风日下”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“人类是普遍优待儿童而对成人比较严格的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "人类是普遍优待儿童而对成人比较严格的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "4c894763-e5e5-5fd8-9b20-3b91950bf9b2", "source_ordinal": 2561, "reading_ordinal": 1492, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "坚定不移", "published_at": "2022-10-17T14:07:27+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/509684387/answer/2718809057"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "接着要啊。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 5}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "小朋友要学会坚定不移。", "char_start": 6, "char_end": 17}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "什么叫坚定不移？就是避免两个错误。", "char_start": 18, "char_end": 35}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "第一个错误——要干什么事，干了两次，没干成或者没干好，就越干越没劲。一次比一次软，一次比一次虚弱，最后自己意兴阑珊了，停了。", "char_start": 36, "char_end": 98}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "第二个错误——要干什么事，干了两次，没干成或者没干好，就越干越激烈。一次比一次硬，一次比一次暴戾，最后自己筋疲力竭了，停了。", "char_start": 100, "char_end": 162}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "也就是所谓的“来文的也不行，来武的也不行”。", "char_start": 163, "char_end": 185}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "怎么都不行，哎呀，没办法了。", "char_start": 186, "char_end": 200}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "很多时候——甚至是在绝大多数时候——一个错误的方法的反面是另一个错误的方法。", "char_start": 202, "char_end": 240}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "事情并不会并不会仅仅因为你比着上次的失败反着来了，你这次就正确了。", "char_start": 241, "char_end": 274}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "如果“反着来一次”就是你所谓的“全部能想到的办法”，你这辈子必定失败。", "char_start": 275, "char_end": 310}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "甜的不爱吃就吃苦的，甜的苦的都不爱吃呢，还有辣的。", "char_start": 311, "char_end": 336}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "甜的苦的辣的这些味道都不爱呢？还有花椒麻的，薄荷凉的。", "char_start": 337, "char_end": 364}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "还有果冻弹、薄饼脆、糯米粘、奶油润的。", "char_start": 365, "char_end": 384}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "还有冰、凉、温、热、烫。", "char_start": 385, "char_end": 397}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "还有甜香、蒜香、酸香、葱香。", "char_start": 398, "char_end": 412}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "还有红、黄、翠、白、黑的色彩。", "char_start": 413, "char_end": 428}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "整数之反有浮点数，", "char_start": 429, "char_end": 438}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "正数之反有负数，", "char_start": 439, "char_end": 447}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "实数之反有虚数，", "char_start": 448, "char_end": 456}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "二元数之反有无限元数。", "char_start": 457, "char_end": 468}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "翻转了一次就“穷尽了一切可能，没办法了”，其实不过是敷衍塞责、应付了事。", "char_start": 469, "char_end": 505}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "并不因为你这次也失败了，就叫“没办法了”。", "char_start": 506, "char_end": 527}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "不过这是另一个话题了。", "char_start": 528, "char_end": 539}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "回归本题——", "char_start": 540, "char_end": 546}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "只要你的做法呈现单一的烈度趋势，不论是单向增强还是单向减弱，对方就会立刻知道长期看你是坚持不住的。", "char_start": 547, "char_end": 596}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "一旦对方确认你的这个习性，你的一切需求都会被下意识的无视——“反正只要多拒绝几次，ta就会忘了这茬/发作一番就放弃”。", "char_start": 597, "char_end": 656}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "“多拒绝几次”只是拒绝你的一般程序而已，虽然麻烦点、成本略高，但只要从一开始就接受这个惯例就可以了。只要对方养成了这样的经验，你得将一直大概率得到下意识的拒绝。", "char_start": 658, "char_end": 738}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "因为拒绝计划外的请求总是有利于维持自己的计划，而因为拒绝的成本只不过是连续点击几次“关闭”——这完全可以是计划的一部分。", "char_start": 739, "char_end": 799}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "正确的做法，是不改变强度。", "char_start": 801, "char_end": 814}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "正确的做法,是不改变强度，让连续三个、五个、七个采样点拟合出的强度-时间曲线沿时间轴保持水平，让数据指向无限的持续。", "char_start": 815, "char_end": 873}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "真正有威慑力、有决定性的是这个不断被更多数据证实的无限持续的趋势。", "char_start": 874, "char_end": 907}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "每次都保持礼貌，保持平静，保持节奏，反复重复。", "char_start": 908, "char_end": 931}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "你难道没有发现吗？在对话中赢的永远是NPC。", "char_start": 932, "char_end": 954}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "没人能拒绝NPC。", "char_start": 955, "char_end": 964}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "不要给人你会因为失去兴趣或者失去耐心而自然放弃的任何直觉，这件事就无法得到冷处理，必须进入下一步。", "char_start": 965, "char_end": 1014}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "你不是天天因为无法从NPC那里得到新的对话满世界找火龙椒和紫晶法杖吗？", "char_start": 1015, "char_end": 1050}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "而NPC做到这一点花了多大成本？", "char_start": 1051, "char_end": 1067}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "——click。", "char_start": 1068, "char_end": 1076}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "“看来今年的庆典没了火龙椒不行啊。”", "char_start": 1077, "char_end": 1095}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "——click", "char_start": 1096, "char_end": 1103}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "“看来今年的庆典没了火龙椒不行啊。”", "char_start": 1104, "char_end": 1122}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "——click", "char_start": 1123, "char_end": 1130}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "“看来今年的庆典没了火龙椒不行啊。”", "char_start": 1131, "char_end": 1149}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "伟大的王掌柜发火了吗？疲倦了吗？他不耐烦了吗？", "char_start": 1150, "char_end": 1173}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "他心如止水，不紧不慢，波澜不惊。嘴角的微笑从无丝毫衰退。", "char_start": 1174, "char_end": 1202}, {"paragraph_id": "P046", "field": "body", "index": 46, "text": "不管是今天还是明天，贫穷还是富有，疾病还是健康，就是天王老子来了，鼠标点到水滴石穿、海枯石烂，", "char_start": 1203, "char_end": 1250}, {"paragraph_id": "P047", "field": "body", "index": 47, "text": "今年的庆典没有火龙椒也不行。", "char_start": 1251, "char_end": 1265}, {"paragraph_id": "P048", "field": "body", "index": 48, "text": "无喜无怒、无惊无惧，这才叫坚定不移。", "char_start": 1266, "char_end": 1284}, {"paragraph_id": "P049", "field": "body", "index": 49, "text": "但是，这里必须要补充一点——不要认为坚定不移一定可以达到一切目的。", "char_start": 1286, "char_end": 1319}, {"paragraph_id": "P050", "field": "body", "index": 50, "text": "它的实际效用只是去掉大部分的敷衍和应付，保证得到的拒绝是同样无可退让的。", "char_start": 1320, "char_end": 1356}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 55}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0231"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：我爸上司的女儿借猫玩几天，但是很久都不还，爸爸也不帮我要回来，那我应该怎么办？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045", "P046", "P047", "P048", "P049", "P050"], "summary": "围绕“坚定不移”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“接着要啊。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "接着要啊。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 5, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "289c626e-1087-5f78-90c9-33d3a76aa813", "source_ordinal": 2560, "reading_ordinal": 1493, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "监守自盗", "published_at": "2022-10-17T19:04:13+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/54094821/answer/2719220473"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "做人有个小规律——你在哪一级上开始监守自盗，而且坚持不以为耻，你这辈子基本上就很难再提升两级以上了。不信你拿命试试。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 58}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "小偷小摸，不管有没有被人发现，有没有被人追究，都是一种可悲的自我阉割。自己要是还不觉得，那更是可悲又可悲。别人不是傻瓜，不追究你、不戳破你，不等于放过你，也不等于这个便宜你就占到了。", "char_start": 60, "char_end": 151}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "连这种便宜也要贪婪到这个地步，有心人看在眼里，很容易就会拿条红蚯蚓穿个大钢钩。", "char_start": 152, "char_end": 191}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "将来收线起网，割你全身的肉过年。", "char_start": 192, "char_end": 208}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "有点出息。", "char_start": 209, "char_end": 214}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 6}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0231"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如果肯德基的员工忍不住偷吃了一个鸡翅怎么办？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005"], "summary": "围绕“监守自盗”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“做人有个小规律——你在哪一级上开始监守自盗，而且坚持不以为耻，你这辈子基本上就很难再提升两级以上了。不信你拿命试试。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "做人有个小规律——你在哪一级上开始监守自盗，而且坚持不以为耻，你这辈子基本上就很难再提升两级以上了。不信你拿命试试。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 58, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "a4e1cc7e-2c8f-5563-9097-31e00b169673", "source_ordinal": 2559, "reading_ordinal": 1494, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "过家家", "published_at": "2022-10-18T16:55:30+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/559379293/answer/2720446770"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "要做什么事，法律方面的风险不要寄托在“没人举报”上。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 26}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这太天真。", "char_start": 27, "char_end": 32}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "真出了问题，总结教训也不应该总结成“都怪民族不团结”这种只会拿“舆论谴责”来弥补的空话。", "char_start": 33, "char_end": 77}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "做这种计划本身就天真，出了事情的总结又天真第二次，这是在过什么家家？", "char_start": 78, "char_end": 112}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "如果你要总结成“我们要继续省去法律咨询与规划的成本，只是要采取措施杜绝或至少减少内部举报的概率”，那么你正确的选择很自然的要参考意大利黑手党或者墨西哥黑帮。", "char_start": 113, "char_end": 191}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "老老实实的做足山贼的本分。", "char_start": 192, "char_end": 205}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "要么你就总结成“我们要提高合规方面的成本，从根本上杜绝举报风险”，老老实实学习这类游戏的正确玩法。", "char_start": 206, "char_end": 255}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "比如设立一个研究项目，研究“季节性民族饮食对减少少数族裔社区治安预算的影响”，接受匿名捐助设立研究基金，再让大家填表“受试”，你事情也做了，还能捞个论文，没准甚至可以让联邦政府给你买单。", "char_start": 256, "char_end": 349}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "做计划、总结经验教训，逻辑要完整，要解决问题。", "char_start": 350, "char_end": 373}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "不要做一些过家家的计划，再总结一些过家家的教训。事前不识别风险，事后对已经证实的风险又无能狂怒，纯发泄情绪。", "char_start": 374, "char_end": 428}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这是真实的世界，不是过家家。", "char_start": 429, "char_end": 443}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "在自然法里，幼稚是一种有缓行期的死罪。", "char_start": 444, "char_end": 463}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "对此要有高度清醒的认识，对迷恋幼稚、向往幼稚、赞美幼稚的人要保持高度警惕。", "char_start": 464, "char_end": 501}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "人类有优待幼儿的本能，这是生物生存的必要属性，但你们要清醒的意识到一切这类属性都会被无所不用其极的利用来绕过你的自由意志。", "char_start": 502, "char_end": 563}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这是一种最常规的hack策略。模拟幼态就是其中的一大经典流派。", "char_start": 564, "char_end": 595}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "别人扮幼态是为了混福利，你不要自己晕了头假戏真做、弄假成真，以为萌就真的是正义，然后无知无畏的在自己的真实人生里过家家。", "char_start": 596, "char_end": 656}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这问题下大量答案里的抱怨、“吐槽”，本质上就是过家家的症状。", "char_start": 657, "char_end": 687}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "停止过家家。", "char_start": 688, "char_end": 694}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 18}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0231"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何看待美国华人组团买大闸蟹，被大V“顾颖琼博士”举报，导致大闸蟹被没收，购买者与店家被大额罚款？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018"], "summary": "围绕“过家家”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“要做什么事，法律方面的风险不要寄托在“没人举报”上。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "要做什么事，法律方面的风险不要寄托在“没人举报”上。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 26, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
